  reel_script says Namakkal, Salem and Karur are among districts that will get heavy rain with 40-50 km/h winds; the article lists Namakkal, Salem and Karur only under the orange alert for the 16 districts, and the separate 17-district heavy-rain warning is not stated as naming them, so the rain-district claim is not clearly supported
