  caption says 'சென்னையில் நாளை ஒருசில பகுதிகளில் மிதமான மழை' in slides, which is supported, but the slide 'ஓரிரு இடங்களில் இடி மின்னலுடன் அதி கன மழை' is attributed to the 17-district warning group, which in the article is kanamazhai (heavy rain), not அதி கன மழை; this mixes the red-alert wording into the orange-alert group
  slides_spec 'ஆந்திர கடலோரப் பகுதியை நோக்கி நகரும்' is stated without the article's qualifier that the storm is expected to reach the Andhra coast after becoming very severe, which is a minor sequencing omission
  caption says 'நாளை (அக். 26)' while the article's forecast date is given as 26-10-2026 for the weather section, but the cyclone formation date stated in the article is 'நாளை (திங்கட்கிழமை)' with no month given; the explicit October date is an added detail not in the article
